<title>FRANCE: EU holds wheat flour export refund at eight Ecus.</title>
<headline>EU holds wheat flour export refund at eight Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday kept its main wheat flour export refund unchanged at eight Ecus per tonne, member country officials said.  </p>
<p>The EU's grain panel also maintained the refund applying to exports of rye flour at 41.00 Ecus per tonne, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
